        "temperament": "Opportunistic",
        "wild": "Andrewsarchus mongoliensis is full of surprises. Despite its ungainly appearance, it can achieve unexpected bursts of speed when provoked. It wades through shallow water comfortably and is an opportunistic feeder that will eat almost anything. It is generally not the first to pick a fight, but when it does engage, its massive jaws and surprising agility make it a dangerous adversary.",
